flowchart TB
    accTitle: BlaBla architecture
    accDescr: project.bla composes behavior and structure contracts. Behavior contracts are parsed and type-checked into one typed contract IR that the behavior verifier runs as a coverage-guided campaign against the application through the trusted runtime, with counterexample shrinking. Structure contracts are parsed into a structure IR that the structure verifier evaluates against facts from a language provider, in v0.5 the Python provider running an embedded AST extractor. The behavior result is recorded with a run-state marker; structure is evaluated live. blabla status, explain and finish render both layers and the OVERALL gate.
    manifest["project.bla<br/>use behavior · use structure · verify behavior"]
    behavior["behavior.bla files"]
    structure["structure.bla files"]
    manifest --> behavior
    manifest --> structure
    subgraph compile["Parsers and typed IR"]
        bparse["behavior parser + semantic checks<br/>src/syntax, src/semantics"] --> bir["Contract IR<br/>src/ir"]
        sparse["structure parser<br/>src/structure/syntax.rs"] --> sir["StructureContract IR<br/>src/structure"]
    end
    behavior --> bparse
    structure --> sparse
    subgraph bverify["Behavior verifier · src/verify"]
        campaign["coverage-guided campaign<br/>generator · corpus · coverage"]
        shrink["counterexample shrinking"]
        runtime["trusted runtime<br/>src/runtime · JSON Lines adapter · runtime::restart"]
        campaign --> shrink
        campaign --> runtime
    end
    subgraph sverify["Structure verifier · src/structure"]
        evaluator["rule evaluator<br/>GREEN · RED · ERROR"]
        registry["provider registry by file extension"]
        python["Python provider<br/>isolated interpreter + embedded ast extractor"]
        evaluator --> registry --> python
    end
    bir --> campaign
    sir --> evaluator
    app["application under verification"]
    runtime <--> app
    python -. reads source text only .-> repo["repository files"]
    record[".blabla/status.json record<br/>.blabla/verifying.json run state<br/>src/project/status.rs · runstate.rs"]
    campaign --> record
    subgraph cli["CLI · src/cli"]
        status["blabla status"]
        explain["blabla explain"]
        finishcmd["blabla finish"]
    end
    record --> status
    evaluator --> status
    record --> explain
    evaluator --> explain
    finishcmd --> evaluator
    finishcmd --> campaign
    status --> overall["BEHAVIOR · STRUCTURE · OVERALL"]
    finishcmd --> overall
